  "adviceTitle": "What I would do about this",
  "adviceNone": "Nothing to flag. The pack is behaving.",
  "adviceImbalanceAtRestTitle": "The cells sit apart even at rest",
  "adviceImbalanceAtRestBody": "With the bike still, the delta reaches {delta} V. With no current involved that is not resistance: the cells simply hold different amounts of charge. Charge to full and leave it sitting for a few hours so the balancer can work; if several charges do not close it, cell {cell} has less capacity than the rest.",
